   "name": "index.ts",
   "filePath": "packages/ssh/subprocess-ssh/src/index.ts",
   "summary": "SSH 远程子进程与 PTY 终端 provider：RemoteProcess 用独立 SSH 流承载 stdin/stdout/stderr/control 并在异步分配期间保持可用；SshSubprocessRuntime 继承 SubprocessRuntime、注入 'ssh' 服务，经 ssh.request RPC 驱动远端 helper 的 prepare/start/terminate/done 生命周期，无法确认终止时释放整条 SSH 连接租约。",
   "tags": [
    "service-provider",
    "ssh",
    "subprocess",
    "rpc",
    "cordis-plugin"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex",
   "languageNotes": "default export 服务类 + static inject 声明（Cordis Service Provider 范式）；OutputCollector 快照经 base64 坐标换算对账，rewind/mismatch 直接抛错而非降级。"
  },
  {
